abstract: >-
  DriveJev is an open-source, efficient System I decision model for autonomous
  driving. At every decision it looks at three camera frames and a short
  description of the situation, scores the behaviours the car can carry out at
  that instant and returns a probability for each in one forward pass. A local
  executor turns the chosen behaviour into steering and speed in the JevPilot
  closed-loop driving world.
